  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Cumbuco Dream Village 302-V is situated on first floor and is composed of 84 square meters (including veranda) with two bedrooms (one suite) with private bathroom, and one social bathroom.</p>\n<p>Kitchen with washing machine, living-room and beautiful veranda with hammocks, chairs and table to enjoy the evening dinner or a cold drink. From the veranda you have a beautiful view of the ocean, the beach and the garden area of the Dream Village condominium.</p>\n<p>Included in the rental: Bed-linen and towels for 4 persons. 2 sets enough for one change. Gas and free WiFi.</p>\n<p><strong>Additional costs:</strong> Electricity and optional services may be charged separately. We will confirm all costs before booking.</p>\n<p>The Cumbuco Dream Village condominium is located some 100 meters from the village of Cumbuco right on the beach.</p>",
